Files derived from EGM, and how they were changed:

- skills/goldfish-comprehension/references/persona.md
  Derived from agents/comprehension.md. Kept the paraphrase-first rule and
  the undefined-term audit; removed BRAINSTORM mode; retargeted the input to
  ODD feature documents (odd/tasks/<feature>.md) and other specs; added a
  structured output with a per-spec (S#) paraphrase.

- skills/goldfish-zoom-out/references/persona.md
  Derived from agents/zoom_out.md. Kept the YAGNI, reuse, premature
  optimization and altitude audit vectors; removed BRAINSTORM mode; made a
  code search mandatory evidence for every reuse claim; added path:line
  evidence requirements.

- skills/goldfish-drift-report/SKILL.md
  Derived from skills/egm-drift-report/SKILL.md. Kept the divergence
  categories and the "report only differences" rule; added ODD spec (S#)
  awareness, per-document delegation to read-only subagents, and an
  explicit uncertain/unverifiable bucket.

